es in both boxes (own box touches divided by own plus opponent box touches). Above 50 means the team spends more of the game in the dangerous end than its opponents do."},{"key":"ppda","label":"PPDA","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Style","desc":"Passes per defensive action: the opponent's passes divided by the team's tackles, interceptions and fouls. A low number means the team presses (it lets the opponent make few passes before engaging). Lower is better for a pressing side."},{"key":"shots","label":"Shots","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Shots attempted per match."},{"key":"shots_against","label":"Shots against","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"Shots faced per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"shot_quality","label":"Shot quality","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"xG per shot: the average quality of the chances a team takes. Higher means better chances, not necessarily more."},{"key":"shot_quality_against","label":"Shot quality against","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"xG per shot faced: the average quality of the chances a team allows. Lower is better."},{"key":"sot_pct","label":"Shots on target %","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Shots on target as a percentage of shots attempted (denominator: shots)."},{"key":"big_chances","label":"Big chances","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Big chances created per match: situations where a goal is expected."},{"key":"big_chances_missed","label":"Big chances missed","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Attack","desc":"Big chances not scored per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"corners","label":"Corners","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Corners won per match."},{"key":"aerial_pct","label":"Aerial duels won","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Aerial duels won as a percentage of aerial duels contested (denominator: aerial duels contested)."},{"key":"ground_duel_pct","label":"Ground duels won","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Ground duels won as a percentage of ground duels contested (denominator: ground duels contested)."},{"key":"passes","label":"Passes","fmt":"int","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Passes attempted per match."},{"key":"pass_pct","label":"Pass completion","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Successful passes as a percentage of passes attempted (denominator: passes attempted)."},{"key":"long_ball_share","label":"Long-ball share","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Long balls attempted as a percentage of passes attempted (denominator: passes attempted): a direct side runs high, a possession side low. Neither is better."},{"key":"crosses","label":"Crosses","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Crosses attempted per match."},{"key":"dribbles","label":"Dribbles","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Dribbles completed per match."},{"key":"fouls","label":"Fouls","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Discipline","desc":"Fouls committed per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"cards","label":"Cards","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Discipline","desc":"Card points per match: one for a yellow, two for a red. Lower is better."},{"key":"km","label":"Distance (km)","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Physical","desc":"Kilometres covered by the whole team per match."},{"key":"sprints","label":"Sprints","fmt":"int","lower":false,"group":"Physical","desc":"Sprints by the whole team per match."},{"key":"rating","label":"Rating","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Sofascore's average 1-10 team rating per match."}],"player_metrics":["rating","ga_90","npxg_xa_90","finishing","placement","xa_per_kp","shot_creation_90","prog_actions_90","padj_tkl_int_90","ball_wins_90","duel_pct","aerial_pct","loss_per_100","pass_pct","km_90","goals_prevented_90","save_pct"]}